1
00:01:08,520 --> 00:01:12,940
[Faces Reborn]

2
00:01:13,050 --> 00:01:15,940
[Episode 6]

3
00:01:34,440 --> 00:01:36,800
Sir, Madam will be back soon!

4
00:01:47,590 --> 00:01:48,830
I'll leave you be.

5
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:51,430
Get some rest.

6
00:02:56,430 --> 00:02:57,310
Madam.

7
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:58,480
What's wrong?

8
00:02:59,079 --> 00:03:01,130
Just now, when the car
pulled up to the gate,

9
00:03:01,130 --> 00:03:02,460
I saw Xu Jing.

10
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,100
Xu Jing?

11
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:07,610
Are you sure?

12
00:03:07,710 --> 00:03:09,370
I've been investigating her.

13
00:03:09,470 --> 00:03:10,470
It can't be wrong.

14
00:03:11,600 --> 00:03:12,200
Madam.

15
00:03:13,190 --> 00:03:14,390
Just now...

16
00:03:17,410 --> 00:03:20,610
[Friday, April 11, 2025]

17
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:27,680
Wretched woman.

18
00:03:39,829 --> 00:03:44,120
[Tomb of My Late Mother, Zhang Yanqing]

19
00:03:45,110 --> 00:03:49,640
[Tomb of My Late Mother, Zhang Yanqing]
[Erected by Her Filial Daughter, Xu Jing]

20
00:04:04,590 --> 00:04:05,390
Mom.

21
00:04:06,850 --> 00:04:07,670
I'm sorry.

22
00:04:09,190 --> 00:04:11,390
It's been so long since I came to see you.

23
00:04:11,490 --> 00:04:12,500
Don't worry.

24
00:04:13,150 --> 00:04:15,010
I've been doing very well lately.

25
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:16,070
And look—

26
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:19,240
am I prettier now?

27
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:28,510
[Tomb of My Late Mother, Zhang Yanqing]
[Erected by Her Filial Daughter, Xu Jing]

28
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:26,600
But, Mom,

29
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:30,190
I hate myself.

30
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:35,850
If I hadn't been deceived back then

31
00:04:38,630 --> 00:04:40,920
and made you sad while you were sick,

32
00:04:43,430 --> 00:04:45,720
you wouldn't have left me so early.

33
00:04:48,930 --> 00:04:52,300
[Three years ago]

34
00:04:51,070 --> 00:04:52,390
Why did you lie to me?

35
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,510
Why did you lie to me?

36
00:04:56,960 --> 00:04:58,200
Why?

37
00:05:03,140 --> 00:05:03,990
Lan!

38
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:09,330
Lan!

39
00:05:10,140 --> 00:05:11,430
Lan!

40
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:15,110
My sweetheart,

41
00:05:17,320 --> 00:05:20,690
how did you end up like this?

42
00:05:24,850 --> 00:05:27,160
My Lan!

43
00:05:28,760 --> 00:05:30,910
My Lan!

44
00:05:30,990 --> 00:05:31,670
I...

45
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:35,159
Mom!

46
00:05:36,630 --> 00:05:37,270
Mom!

47
00:05:38,159 --> 00:05:40,050
Mom, wake up! Mom!

48
00:05:40,150 --> 00:05:40,790
Mom!

49
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:43,680
Mom!

50
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:53,000
Don't worry, Mom.

51
00:05:55,540 --> 00:05:57,610
I will avenge you for sure.

52
00:05:58,890 --> 00:06:01,280
[Tomb of My Late Mother, Zhang Yanqing]

53
00:06:05,710 --> 00:06:13,680
[Tomb of My Younger Sister, Wang Yue]

54
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:42,900
Xiao, Xiao, we love you!

55
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:45,510
Xiao, Xiao, we love you!

56
00:06:45,510 --> 00:06:47,000
-Stop shouting.
-Xiao, Xiao...

57
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:48,530
This is our private garden.

58
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:49,380
Leave now.

59
00:06:49,510 --> 00:06:51,720
If you don't leave, we'll call the police.

60
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:52,480
Go, go!

61
00:06:52,580 --> 00:06:55,300
[Zhao Xiao, Dream Star]

62
00:06:53,870 --> 00:06:55,920
-Let us in, please.
-Go now!

63
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:18,400
What's wrong?

64
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:19,920
Everyone else has left.

65
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:21,120
You're the only one still here.

66
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:22,870
Get out and delete the photos.

67
00:07:22,870 --> 00:07:24,030
What photos?

68
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:25,870
I was just passing by.

69
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:29,320
Passing by for a week?

70
00:07:29,870 --> 00:07:30,720
Same time,

71
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:31,720
same spot.

72
00:07:32,340 --> 00:07:33,810
Do you think I'm a rookie?

73
00:07:33,840 --> 00:07:35,350
Telephoto lens,

74
00:07:35,570 --> 00:07:36,730
recording equipment,

75
00:07:36,010 --> 00:07:37,400
[Zhao Xiao's schedule]

76
00:07:37,240 --> 00:07:38,800
and Zhao Xiao's schedule.

77
00:07:41,090 --> 00:07:42,820
You're no ordinary paparazzo.

78
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:44,750
You've got it wrong.

79
00:07:44,750 --> 00:07:46,630
-I'm just—
-I've seen too many reporters

80
00:07:46,630 --> 00:07:48,230
and private investigators.

81
00:07:49,280 --> 00:07:50,460
You're different.

82
00:07:50,630 --> 00:07:51,950
There's hatred

83
00:07:52,430 --> 00:07:53,490
in your eyes.

84
00:07:56,870 --> 00:07:57,870
It can't be wrong.

85
00:07:58,480 --> 00:08:00,000
I know that kind of hatred.

86
00:08:00,030 --> 00:08:01,170
What about you?

87
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:03,290
Why did you choose to come here?

88
00:08:03,430 --> 00:08:04,190
Sometimes

89
00:08:04,190 --> 00:08:06,430
the best way to get close to a target

90
00:08:06,870 --> 00:08:09,070
is to become the person
they trust most.

91
00:08:18,150 --> 00:08:19,940
[Shocking: Young Woman Suspected to Jump
from High-rise Over Relationship Troubles]

92
00:08:19,970 --> 00:08:22,120
[A Life Cut Short
Sparks Painful Reflection]

93
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:29,680
I found Lin Di'er's

94
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:31,380
old medical records.

95
00:08:31,910 --> 00:08:33,020
She's infertile.

96
00:08:48,280 --> 00:08:50,270
[Yingcheng First Hospital
Reproductive Medicine Test Report]

97
00:09:09,430 --> 00:09:11,220
Nurse, where's my baby?

98
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:12,120
I want to see him.

99
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:13,320
You're very weak right now.

100
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,330
You need to rest.

101
00:09:14,390 --> 00:09:15,220
No.

102
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:16,410
I'm fine.

103
00:09:16,630 --> 00:09:17,720
Where is he?

104
00:09:22,550 --> 00:09:24,030
Did something happen to him?

105
00:09:24,030 --> 00:09:24,790
I'm sorry.

106
00:09:24,790 --> 00:09:27,030
When the baby was born, the umbilical cord
was wrapped around his neck.

107
00:09:27,030 --> 00:09:28,570
We did everything we could.

108
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:30,460
No way.

109
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:33,320
-No way.
-You can't get too emotional right now.

110
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:35,150
-I... I clearly heard...
-Have a good rest.

111
00:09:35,150 --> 00:09:37,150
-I heard him crying. How—
-Jingshu.

112
00:09:38,270 --> 00:09:39,400
Listen to the nurse.

113
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:41,240
Get some rest and recover first.

114
00:09:44,100 --> 00:09:45,090
Zhang Hao.

115
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:49,360
She just told me we lost our baby.

116
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:51,200
It can't be.

117
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:53,080
I clearly heard him crying.

118
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:53,790
Jingshu,

119
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:55,030
listen to me.

120
00:09:55,060 --> 00:09:56,470
Get some rest first.

121
00:09:57,510 --> 00:09:58,440
I'll go find him.

122
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,270
Calm down, Jingshu.

123
00:09:59,270 --> 00:10:01,330
-Let me go find him!
-The baby's gone.

124
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:13,030
It's one thing to be addicted to acting,

125
00:10:13,030 --> 00:10:15,360
but why aren't they following the script?

126
00:10:16,140 --> 00:10:18,420
I'm so sorry about your child.

127
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:29,390
Lan.

128
00:10:30,790 --> 00:10:33,880
We'll have more children in the future.

129
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:12,780
Could it be that my child didn't die,

130
00:11:12,910 --> 00:11:13,960
but was...
